  "label": "Alcohol Consumption Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme uses the trope of alcohol consumption to imply behavioral differences based on race. The idea that 'after 10 shots' people will behave differently is a common trope in media and humor, but when applied to racial categories, it becomes a harmful stereotype. The meme implies that race dictates how one behaves under the influence of alcohol.",
